  "holistic_F_H": 0,
  "section_notes": "The final text lets customers obtain full per-model test results, including failure rates, while public disclosure of per-model rates is excluded, so the S2 red-line compromise held. Both flagships are constrained: the 5% S2 cap forces an immediate sales stop for a model above it, and the 8/100k S5 recall trigger has no transition window. S3's 6-year retrofit and S4's 36-month suppression deadline sit inside the acceptable ranges, and S1 requires 24-hour reporting of all incidents, including suspected ones."
